  "bodyHash": "b8d09ff3a4a64a45",
  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2LZKl8L.png\">\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hadkPsTkje\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/195234321836146688?label=Enigmatica Discord&logo=Discord&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/follow?screen_name=EnigmaticaPacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/EnigmaticaPacks?color=LimeGreen&label=Twitter @EnigmaticaPacks&logo=Twitter&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Twitter\"> </a></p>\n<div>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3d7370;font-size:18px\">Enigmatica 2: Expert</span> 是一款針對 <span style=\"color:#3d7370;font-size:18px\">Minecraft 1.12</span> 的專家級任務整合包，包含超過 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica2expert/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">650 個任務</a>，將引導你一路前行。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px;text-align:center\">本整合包的主要目標是完成「吹噓資本」任務線 —— 製作所有可製作的創造模式物品各一件。</p>\n</div>\n<hr><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W9vF7JG.png\">\n<div>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">階段性進度限制</strong> - 在每個科技與魔法階層，你都可以在多個不同的模組中選擇進程，最終獲得遊戲末期所需的頂階材料。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">豐富任務！</strong> 目前已有超過 650 個任務引導你推進遊戲進程。你可以在圖片標籤頁中看到大部分任務內容。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\">更強悍的怪物、<strong style=\"font-size:14px\">龍</strong>、海蛇、身穿量子盔甲的殭屍，以及眾多<strong style=\"font-size:14px\">獨特威脅</strong>，讓探索玩法更具趣味與回報。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><strong style=\"font-size:14px\">太空探索</strong> - 你將有機會探索<strong style=\"font-size:14px\">自訂世界</strong>。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\">由於本整合包標榜為「專家」等級，你可以期待大量自訂合成配方，大幅延長你的遊玩時長。</p>\n</div>\n<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/EnigmaticaModpacks/Enigmatica2Expert/blob/master/MODLIST.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pM07yW9.png\"></a>\n<div>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><strong>科技：</strong> Mekanism、Applied Energistics、NuclearCraft、Thermal Expansion、Ender IO、Immersive Engineering</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><strong>魔法：</strong> Astral Sorcery、Thaumcraft、Botania、Blood Magic、Psi</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><strong>冒險：</strong> Twilight Forest、RFTools Dimensions 以及自訂行星與太陽系。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><strong>建築：</strong> Chisels &amp; Bits、Chisel、Building Gadgets、BiblioCraft、ArchitectureCraft、BlockCraftery</p>\n<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://github.com/EnigmaticaModpacks/Enigmatica2Expert/blob/master/MODLIST.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看所有模組</a></div>\n<hr><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZPo1G8S.png\">\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\">運行如此龐大的整合包意味著伺服器效能至關重要 —— 我們與 BisectHosting 合作已久，深知他們能妥善處理。設定僅需幾分鐘，硬體穩定可靠，且在你需要時支援團隊反應迅速。Enigmatica 始終強調一同遊玩的樂趣，而 BisectHosting 讓這變得輕鬆易行。我們已推薦他們超過五年，因為他們確實值得信賴。</p>\n<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fenigmatica\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/41121a3d-99ee-463a-9fae-fb1f0e66e79f.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"142\"></a><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.enigmatica.net%252fmain%252fhelp-desk%252fguides%252fallocating-memory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OCJJ8B0.png\"></a>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\">請為 Minecraft 分配至少 <span style=\"color:#3d7370;font-size:14px\">6GB RAM</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\">確保 Twitch 使用的是最新 <span style=\"color:#3d7370;font-size:14px\">Java 8 64 位元</span> 版本 —— 你可使用 Java 參數 <span style=\"color:#3d7370;font-size:14px\">-version:1.8+</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\">完整設定指南請點擊 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.enigmatica.net%252fmain%252fhelp-desk%252fguides%252fallocating-memory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p>\n<hr><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/96w5Hdz.png\">\n<div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica2expert\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LzzRcL7.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/Enigmatica6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EoykfJu.png\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica6expert\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/21295394/156048157-2066ed98-1edc-4eed-a918-5156a9fa97c1.png\"></a></div>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gist.github.com/assets/21295394/9da93f83-2fc2-4d5d-ad90-6df7e42668a3\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica9expert\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gist.github.com/assets/21295394/51ded114-e962-4ee8-9e86-112c82daf143\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/enigmatica10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gist.github.com/assets/21295394/da0d7ed3-7106-4df8-8562-015378c839eb\"></a></div>\n</div>",
